{"seq":2,"slug":"twenty-years-at-the-academy","title":"Twenty Years At The Academy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/twenty-years-at-the-academy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"student-of-plato","title":"柏拉图的学生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/twenty-years-at-the-academy/student-of-plato","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"breaking-with-plato","title":"与柏拉图的分歧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/twenty-years-at-the-academy/breaking-with-plato","wordCount":1505,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现亚里士多德在柏拉图学园的二十年。从十七岁进入学园，到柏拉图去世，亚里士多德深受其师熏陶，打下了坚实的哲学基础，是西方最伟大师承（苏格拉底→柏拉图→亚里士多德）的体现。然而，他并非盲从的追随者——&quot;吾爱吾师，吾更爱真理&quot;，他以独立的精神，批判了柏拉图的理念论，最终成长为一位独立的思想家。本章揭示这段亦承亦争的师徒关系。</p>\n"}